license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/optimuslabs-io/skillsgoat"
abstract: >
  Deliberately vulnerable agent-skill corpus (WebGoat for SKILL.md bundles)
  for evaluating skill scanners. 74 atomic fixtures (64 malicious, 10 benign)
  plus compound chains. Payloads are inert.
